Reuse statement
---------------
No upstream source file was copied into this repository. Every file under
`src/` was written anew for PickupPop in the `com.pickuppop` namespace;
only behavioral ideas (event-driven pickup detection via the client
take-item packet, count-merging aggregation, entry expiry, HUD layout and
configuration groups) were carried over. See docs/LICENSE_COMPLIANCE.md
for the file-by-file audit.

The MPL-2.0 license header (Exhibit A notice) is included at the top of
every source file. PickupPop as a whole is distributed under MPL-2.0;
see LICENSE.

