identity; "PickupPop" is this adaptation's own name, mod id
(`pickuppop`) and visual identity.

Third-party code NOT reused
---------------------------
- `TransparencyBuffer` (upstream, adapted from ClientStorage under
  LGPL-3.0): deliberately NOT copied. PickupPop renders sprites directly
  without an extra framebuffer.
- `DisplayEntryRenderHelper` tooltip-gradient rendering: NOT copied;
  PickupPop implements only NONE/CHAT backgrounds.
- Puzzles Lib / Architectury APIs: NOT used; PickupPop depends only on
  Fabric Loader, Fabric API, Yarn mappings and Minecraft itself.
